{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297790","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297790","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029779001:0":{"text":"얘들아, 얌전히 있어! 함부로 뛰어다니거나 싸우면 안 돼!","source_cn":"孩子们，大家要乖乖的哦，不要乱跑，也不要打架——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x748061D7B534D46C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029779002:1":{"text":"아르사! 우르 부족 아이들을 데리고 놀러왔어요?","source_cn":"阿尔萨！你带着乌尔氏族的孩子们过来玩了啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x390A1E8147E4B5D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029779003:0":{"text":"아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나! 안녕!\n얘들아, 일단 놀고 있어. 금방 볼일만 보고 올게!","source_cn":"啊，<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14A677BC8F1213DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나! 안녕!\n얘들아, 일단 놀고 있어. 금방 볼일만 보고 올게!","female":"아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나! 안녕!\n얘들아, 일단 놀고 있어. 금방 볼일만 보고 올게!","variant_male_record_index":"104712","variant_female_record_index":"104713","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029779003":{"text":"아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나! 안녕!\n얘들아, 일단 놀고 있어. 금방 볼일만 보고 올게!","source_cn":"啊，<style=stress><player_name></style>，你们来了呀！日安！\\n孩子们，先解散，姐姐有事要忙！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14A677BC8F1213DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나! 안녕!\n얘들아, 일단 놀고 있어. 금방 볼일만 보고 올게!","female":"아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 왔구나! 안녕!\n얘들아, 일단 놀고 있어. 금방 볼일만 보고 올게!","variant_male_record_index":"104712","variant_female_record_index":"104713","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029779004:1":{"text":"헤헤, 이번에 출발하기 전에 밖에 나가면 꼭 얌전히 있어야 한다고 말했거든. 다행히 다들 말을 잘 듣네!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，毕竟这次出门前我就和孩子们说，出门在外必须乖乖的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A754E53E0D3902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029779005:1":{"text":"혼자 온 거예요? 소렌은 왜 같이 안 왔어요?","source_cn":"索恩怎么没陪着你一起来？只有你吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31C502E199C02B29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029779006:1":{"text":"소렌은 상단 일로 바빠. 난 브루투스 님이 며칠 쉬라고 하셔서 아이들을 데리고 놀러온 거야.","source_cn":"索恩还在忙着照顾商队，布鲁特斯大人说应该让我放松几天，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50B9A20597B9020A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029779007:1":{"text":"겸사겸사 내가 한 일도 좀 확인해 보고 싶었거든.","source_cn":"也是顺路看看这段时间我经营的成果嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B43593B8ACBB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1029779007":{"text":"겸사겸사 내가 한 일도 좀 확인해 보고 싶었거든.","source_cn":"也是顺路看看这段时间我经营的成果嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B43593B8ACBB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029779008:1":{"text":"헤헤, 문서에 적힌 숫자만 봤을 땐 물건을 얼마나 팔았는지 별로 실감이 안 났거든?","source_cn":"嘿嘿，光是看账目数字上说我们的货物销量很好，总觉得没什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89109334D89EFC8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029779009:1":{"text":"그런데 여기서 우리 우르 부족 특산품을 파는걸 보니까 확실히 느낌이 다르네.","source_cn":"在这里看到有人在卖我们乌尔氏族的特产时，感觉就特别不一样啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1943159B3B5EFE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1029779009":{"text":"그런데 여기서 우리 우르 부족 특산품을 파는걸 보니까 확실히 느낌이 다르네.","source_cn":"在这里看到有人在卖我们乌尔氏族的特产时，感觉就特别不一样啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1943159B3B5EFE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029779010:0":{"text":"그렇게 재밌는 거라면 가야지! 당장 소렌에게 알려서... 아니, 브루투스 님에게도 알려드려야겠다!","source_cn":"这种热闹我肯定要来呀！我立刻就通知索恩他们……不，还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFBEC6D679F5649C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029779011:0":{"text":"아, 맞아. 물건도 더 챙겨야 해. 빈손으로 돌아갈 수는 없지!","source_cn":"不过，索恩倒是还好，布鲁特斯大人他们应该还在雪松镇观光...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7118B0E4922A603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029779012:0":{"text":"그런데 소렌은 그렇다 치고, 브루투스 님은 아직 시더 마을을 구경하고 계실 텐데... 언제 오시려나?","source_cn":"曼卡拉小姐更是不知道跑到哪去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7399B5DD536D9E4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029779013:0":{"text":"칼라도 어디 계신지 모르겠어!","source_cn":"既然如此……就让索恩带上更多的货物，我们可不能空手而回！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8577CABF11ECA933","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029779014:0":{"text":"그럼... 일단 소렌한테 물건을 더 챙기라고 해야겠다. 빈손으로 돌아갈 수는 없지!","source_cn":"阿尔萨已经越来越会做生意了啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1549DCA0D168C803","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029779015:0":{"text":"아르사, 점점 장사꾼답네요!","source_cn":"那当然，我可是学什么都非常快的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45C3F437B054F0E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029779016:0":{"text":"당연하지. 난 뭐든 금방 배우거든!","source_cn":"那么，我这就先离开了，回见——你们也加油哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06217815995B0E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"(축제와 시장 계획을 알려준다)","source_cn":"（告知庆典和集市的计划）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC4DD6DBF99101680","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(축제와 시장 계획을 알려준다)","female":"(축제와 시장 계획을 알려준다)","variant_male_record_index":"60340","variant_female_record_index":"60341","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"느낌이 어때?","source_cn":"感觉如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEE445418FBE0ECD4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"느낌이 어때?","female":"느낌이 어때?","variant_male_record_index":"60328","variant_female_record_index":"60329","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"능숙하네!","source_cn":"指挥若定！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65906746F54B1072","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"능숙하네!","female":"능숙하네!","variant_male_record_index":"60326","variant_female_record_index":"60327","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":2}}